{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[WARNING: This game is difficult and offers very little guidance/handholding which can be frustrating for some players. If you think that you might be interested in this game, please try out the FREE DEMO before buying.]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Chiral</strong>, a sci-fi psychological horror/comedy first person puzzle game, where you'll assume the role of a disembodied brain in a jar, paired with a digital AI companion. Together, you'll navigate a labyrinth of mirror, laser, and gravity puzzles that will challenge your spatial reasoning.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106330/extras/a87f0b33fc6588ee898a8adb4daabbe3.poster.avif?t=1755798604\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106330/extras/a87f0b33fc6588ee898a8adb4daabbe3.webm?t=1755798604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106330/extras/a87f0b33fc6588ee898a8adb4daabbe3.mp4?t=1755798604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a &quot;routine&quot; brain transfer procedure, you find yourself in a jar, but don't worry\u2014you'll still be a valuable asset to the corporation! As you traverse the eerie and captivating levels, you'll encounter mind-bending spatial puzzles and corrupted robotic managers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106330/extras/e02dd6178402ecf42a8852eb68400e7c.poster.avif?t=1755798604\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106330/extras/e02dd6178402ecf42a8852eb68400e7c.webm?t=1755798604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106330/extras/e02dd6178402ecf42a8852eb68400e7c.mp4?t=1755798604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spatial Puzzles: Test your intellect with complex mirror, laser, and gravity challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Humor: Enjoy a storyline infused with a creepy yet comedic tone. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Mechanics: Utilize your ability to cross through mirrors, manipulate objects, alter gravity., and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric World: Immerse yourself in the unsettlingly delightful corporate dystopia with a brutalist foundation sprinkled with some cartoony augmented reality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106330/extras/59a55174118b4971980fe89cbda6f51a.poster.avif?t=1755798604\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106330/extras/59a55174118b4971980fe89cbda6f51a.webm?t=1755798604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106330/extras/59a55174118b4971980fe89cbda6f51a.mp4?t=1755798604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter<strong> Chiral </strong>and embrace the madness. Your brain will never be the same again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106330/extras/3fe40ff634b042389d418e84d6821fc6.poster.avif?t=1755798604\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106330/extras/3fe40ff634b042389d418e84d6821fc6.webm?t=1755798604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106330/extras/3fe40ff634b042389d418e84d6821fc6.mp4?t=1755798604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"CHIRAL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3106330/93ee2c5359f5a07cc3c9033791bfda4489ebf931.jpg"},{"name":"SCAT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3106330/8154591b686a35d8d1b7f27b6de2ddbcc757b1eb.jpg"},{"name":"Collectathoner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3106330/a9daa005e6b180ce213e5c9cd84b5f472169ad84.jpg"},{"name":"MEEP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3106330/9c60e5e6e17e2561d647a95f9a447a44087142b3.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3106330/74190240f44c617ad36ce84614fb6fe394226701.jpg"},{"name":"IDIQT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3106330/6a0af84377867ff2b57bd1c14cb8a7816e1964fb.jpg"},{"name":"The Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3106330/c7f0697a51a9575a6cdfcbae6b9440f0b1d3ec10.jpg"},{"name":"The Hand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3106330/0f7ae30d498e639557a3f8d7de451a9fe3bef4ba.jpg"},{"name":"The Brain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image